msgid "**Advanced openresty load-balancing strategies.** v1 uses default round-robin in the per-app `upstream` block. Weighted distribution, least-connections, sticky sessions (`ip_hash` / cookie-based), and active HTTP healthchecks are out of scope. Adding them is a follow-up requirement and only becomes load-bearing once a service is regularly run with replicas > 1, which itself depends on shared storage being NFS-backed for that service."
msgstr "**Advanced openresty load- keseimbangan strategi.** v1 gunakan default bundaran-robin dalam per- app `upstream` Hadang. distribusi Weighted, least-connection, sticky sessions (`ip_hash` / cookie- berbasis), dan aktif HTTP pemeriksaan yang di luar jangkauan. Menambahkan mereka adalah persyaratan berikut-up dan hanya menjadi tempat-bantalan sekali layanan secara teratur dijalankan dengan replika > 1, yang sendiri tergantung pada berbagi penyimpanan menjadi NFS- didukung untuk layanan itu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Agen dashboard publik di belakang proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` dan `web-app-openclaw` ikuti standar `web-app-*` kontrak: domain kanonikal sendiri, reverse- proxy routing, SSO dipaksa melalui [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes menggunakan dukungan OIDC. OpenClaw 's native OIDC adalah upstream belum diverifikasi: jika tidak hadir, dasbor duduk di belakang platform standar teks-proxy pola (SSO dipaksa di proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying proceal- only)Tidak ada permukaan publik yang belum dikonfirmasi dengan cara baik."

