# libretranslate
msgid "**Avoid Root Logins & Plaintext Passwords** Infinito.Nexus MUST NOT allow logging in via the root user or using simple passwords. Instead, an SSH key MUST be generated and transferred during system initialization. When executing commands as root, always use `sudo` (or, if necessary, `sudo su`, but only if you understand the risks). (More information on [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) and [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) is available on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Hindari Log Masuk Root & Sandi Plaintext** Infinito.Nexus HARUS TIDAK mengijinkan log masuk melalui pengguna root atau menggunakan password sederhana. Sebaliknya, kunci SSH HARUS dihasilkan dan ditransfer selama inisialisasi sistem. Ketika mengeksekusi perintah sebagai root, selalu gunakan `sudo` (atau, jika perlu, `sudo su`, tetapi hanya jika Anda memahami risiko). (Informasi lebih lanjut pada [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) dan [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) tersedia di Wikipedia.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backend routing:** Model entries are generated for Ollama and LM Studio when those services run on the host, under the shared alias each model carries so a consumer names one model whichever local backend answers it."
msgstr "**Routing latar belakang:** Entri model dihasilkan untuk Ollama dan LM Studio ketika layanan tersebut dijalankan pada host, di bawah alias bersama Setiap model membawa sehingga nama konsumen satu model mana backend lokal menjawabnya."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup & Disaster Recovery** 💾 Scheduled backups and scripted recovery processes to safeguard your data."
msgstr "**Pemulihan Backup & Bencana** 💾 Merencanakan backup dan proses pemulihan naskah untuk menjaga data Anda."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Friendly:** Data isolated under ``{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}``."
msgstr "**Bantuan Friendly:** Data terisolasi di bawah ``{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Friendly:** Data isolated under `{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}`."
msgstr "**Bantuan Friendly:** Data terisolasi di bawah `{{ CONFLUENCE_HOME }}`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Layout:** Consolidated all backups under /var/lib/infinito, parameterized the pull workflow, switched to dump-only backups, and disabled Redis backups across web applications."
msgstr "**Tata Letak Backup:** Mengkonsolidasi semua backup di bawah / var / lib / infinito, paremeterisasi arus kerja tarik, beralih ke dump-only backup, dan dinonaktifkan Redis backup melalui aplikasi web."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Ready:** Persistent data under ``{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}``."
msgstr "**Cadangan Siap:** Persist data di bawah ``{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup Ready:** Persistent data under `{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}`."
msgstr "**Cadangan Siap:** Persist data di bawah `{{ JIRA_STORAGE_PATH }}`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup and disaster recovery.** *svc-bkp-container-2-local* is superseded by *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, making backup policy explicit per volume. The role prefers filesystem snapshots when available and can prepare btrfs hosts for snapshot-based backups itself. New *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* protects the shared NFS export, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* captures secret material, and *svc-bkp-local-2-device* synchronizes backups to mounted external media. A unified *recover* CLI drives restores, while Compose recovery checks and a full Swarm disaster-recovery drill continuously verify the path. Rsync no longer retains superseded files as *~* copies."
msgstr "**Bantuan dan pemulihan bencana.** *svc-bkp-reasger-2-local* Digantikan oleh *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, membuat kebijakan cadangan eksplisit per volume. Peran ini lebih suka snapshot filesystem ketika tersedia dan dapat mempersiapkan host btrfs untuk snapshot - berbasis backup itu sendiri. Baru *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* melindungi ekspor NFS bersama, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* menangkap materi rahasia, dan *svc-bkp-local-2-device* sinkronisasi backup ke media eksternal yang dikait. Terpadu *pemulihan* CLI drive restore, sementara Compose pemeriksaan pemulihan dan berantakan penuh-pemulihan bor terus-menerus memverifikasi jalan. Rsync tidak lagi mempertahankan berkas yang diganti sebagai *~* dimengerti."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup integration:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshots the model volume when that role is present, without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Integrasi backup:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshot model volume ketika peran yang ada, tanpa menghentikan wadah."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup user SSH access was hardened:** backup keys are wrapped with a forced command wrapper and written via the shared user role; config is now users.backup.authorized_keys."
msgstr "**Akses cadangan pengguna SSH mengeras:** kunci cadangan dibungkus dengan pembungkus perintah paksa dan ditulis melalui peran pengguna bersama; konfigurasi sekarang users.backup.authorized_keys."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup/cleanup services are more reliable:** run-once flags execute earlier, user-backup is an explicit dependency, and cleanback now uses a configurable backups root and keeps the newest backups by default (force-keep=3)."
msgstr "**Layanan backup / cleanup lebih dapat diandalkan:** jalankan - sekali flag eksekusi sebelumnya, user-backup adalah sebuah ketergantungan eksplisit, dan pemurnian sekarang menggunakan sebuah akar backup yang dapat diatur dan menjaga backup terbaru secara baku (paksa -keep =3)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Baseline deploy**: a successful `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` run as defined in [Compose Loop](compose.md)."
msgstr "**Baseline menyebarkan**: sukses `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` jalankan seperti didefinisikan dalam [Buat Loop](compose.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Baudolo-compatible layout:** snapshots land in the same `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` tree as the container backups, so pull and cleanup tooling applies unchanged."
msgstr "**Tata letak Baudolo - kompatibel:** snapshots land in the same `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` pohon sebagai backup kontainer, jadi tarik dan bersihkan barang berlaku tidak berubah."

