# libretranslate
msgid "**Beware of Phishing and Social Engineering** You MUST verify email senders, avoid clicking on unknown links, and MUST NEVER share your passwords or 2FA codes with anyone. (Learn more about [Phishing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) and [Social Engineering](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Waspadailah Phishing dan Teknik Sosial** Anda HARUS memverifikasi pengirim email, menghindari klik pada link yang tidak diketahui, dan HARUS PERNAH berbagi sandi atau 2Kode FA dengan siapa pun. (Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang [Filshing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) dan [Rekayasa Sosial](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) di Wikipedia.)"

# libretranslate
