msgid "**Defaults** discovered from each role's per-topic meta files: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, plus `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (post-`apply_schema()`). Variants from `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` deep-merge over the assembled per-role payload. See [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."
msgstr "**Baku** ditemukan dari setiap berkas meta topik per- peran: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, plus `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (pos-`apply_schema()`)Varians dari `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` merge lebih dalam dari muatan per- role yang dirakit. Lihat [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."

