# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Menyebarkan iterasi.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-mengambil rencana yang sama melalui `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (perencana adalah fungsi murni bersama antara init dan menyebarkan) dan menjalankan satu menyebarkan per folder. **Setiap ronde menyebarkan variasinya secara penuh dan sadar termasuk set.** Ronde R dimulai dari host yang bersih (babak sebelumnya termasuk dibersihkan sebelum bulat R dimulai, lihat titik 5), jadi setiap dep bahwa putaran R kebutuhan HARUS dikerahkan kembali."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Menyebarkan pada Server Terenkripsi** Anda HARUS memasang Infinito.Nexus di server terenkripsi untuk mencegah penyedia host dari mengakses data pengguna akhir. Untuk panduan praktis pada pengaturan server terenkripsi, merujuk ke [repositori Hetzner Arch LUKS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang [enkripsi disk](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) di Wikipedia.)"

