# libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**Penyebaran dan pengepakan yayasan.** Sebuah mode penyebaran host bergabung Compose dan Swarm dalam penyebaran tooling. Mantan *paket sys-*, *sys-aur* dan *sys- aur- install* peran diganti oleh distribusi - independen paket registry. Metadata Volume sekarang menggunakan salah satu skema kanonikal, skema berkas tunggal menjadi config Swarm, dan penempatan layanan, jumlah replika, ketergantungan, alamat dan probe kesehatan menyelesaikan melalui pencarian-sadar."

