msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Jangan waspada ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao menyimpan ruang-nama metrik Vault, dan node yang tidak disegel yang sehat memancarkan ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, jadi peringatan pada ``== 0`` kebakaran permanen. Gunakan ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 dan ditutup rapat,); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` menguatkan."

# libretranslate
