# libretranslate
msgid "**End-to-end validated in CI on 2026-06-02:** `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (3-node DinD + NFS server) reaches all 17 steps green; `15_assert_state.sh` confirms `replicas: 1/1` after drain, the pre-drain marker on the NFS-backed `mediawiki_images` volume is readable from the new node, and MediaWiki HTTP responds inside the rescheduled container. See run logs at `/tmp/act-swarm-nfs-110.log`."
msgstr "**End-to-end validasi dalam CI pada 2026-06-02:** `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (3-node server DinD + NFS) menjangkau semua 17 langkah-langkah hijau; `15_assert_state.sh` dikonfirmasi `replicas: 1/1` setelah menguras, penanda pre- drain pada NFS- didukung `mediawiki_images` volume dapat dibaca dari titik baru, dan MediaWiki HTTP merespon di dalam wadah yang dijadwalkan ulang. Lihat log run di `/tmp/act-swarm-nfs-110.log`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Enforce 2FA and Use a Password Manager** Administrators MUST enforce [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) and SHOULD use a password manager with auto-generated passwords. We recommend [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). The KeePass database can be stored securely in your Nextcloud instance and synchronized between devices."
msgstr "**Paksa 2FA dan Gunakan Manajer Sandi** Administrator HARUS memaksa [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) dan harus menggunakan manajer sandi dengan password yang dihasilkan otomatis. Kami merekomendasikan [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). Database KeePass dapat disimpan dengan aman di dalam Anda Nextcloud instance dan disinkronkan antara perangkat."

