# libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Tetap**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Tetap:** Migrasi OpenProject stabil (langkah migrasi yang disederhanakan; preload *Konteks Custom FieldContext* sebelum *db: migrasi*). Nextcloud LDAP config hard and compatible apps disabled in production. Ekstensi XWiki pasang mengeras dan satu kali benih memastikan *Main.WebHome* Ada. Matomo bootstrap gagal cepat pada penyebab akar. TLS dan CA perbaikan (unified self signed CA env for health services, retres for CA trust generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* peningkatan pada Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* buat prasyarat dan header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* kebijakan ditambahkan. Backup dan ops perbaikan (OnlyOffice tidak ada restart selama backup; backup rumah dan tugas ACL lebih dapat diandalkan)Kontainer pengaturan mengeras (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 tambahkan lagi, perbaikan konflik Debian buildx, kesiapan Docker dan peningkatan SSH)."

