# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Folder inventaris.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) panggilan [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), yang membuat satu folder per bulat di `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (atau hanya `<inventory-dir>` Ketika ada satu putaran)Untuk setiap folder, `build_dev_inventory` memecahkan muatan per- app putaran dan bakes ke dalam inventaris `host_vars` sebagai `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. Inventaris oleh karena itu variant- diselesaikan pada disk; tidak ada pemilih runtime dibutuhkan."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` or `host_vars` of the target environment."
msgstr "**Inventaris pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` atau `host_vars` dari lingkungan sasaran."

# libretranslate
