# libretranslate
msgid "**Local models reach the gateway again.** Upstream re-pushed the *svc-ai-lmstudio* CPU image with a server that listens on loopback only, so the role stayed green while litellm could not connect and the AI features of Mattermost, Matrix, xWiki, Moodle and Zammad failed their warm-up. The server binds the container network again and stays unpublished. The model preload now waits until the daemon has finished starting, so a slow host no longer ends up with a daemon that fails every later model load, and the readiness probe is capped per attempt so a silent peer cannot hang it. See [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."
msgstr "**Model lokal mencapai gerbang lagi.** Upstream kembali-mendorong *svc-ai-lmstudio* Gambar CPU dengan server yang hanya mendengarkan loop-back, sehingga peran tetap hijau sementara litellm tidak dapat menyambung dan fitur AI Mattermost, Matrix, xWiki, Moodle dan Zammad gagal mereka perang-up. Server mengikat jaringan kontainer lagi dan tetap tidak dipublikasikan. Model preload sekarang menunggu sampai jurik telah selesai dimulai, sehingga host lambat tidak lagi berakhir dengan jurik yang gagal setiap beban model kemudian, dan penyelidikan kesiapan adalah capped per upaya sehingga peer diam tidak bisa menggantungnya. Lihat [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."

