# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Mitigasi:** Mutasi tingkat Image- (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) dan sinonim mereka (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) masih rute melalui `ask`, jadi operator mengulas mereka sebelum mereka mengeksekusi."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Mitigasi:** Target masih tidak dapat bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, atau `deny` daftar. Sebuah target berbahaya yang disebut `rm -rf .` akan dihentikan oleh `rm -rf*` menyangkal aturan."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Mitigasi:** `docker run*` dan sinonim nya berada di `ask`, jadi operator mengulas mereka (subyek ke Asumsi 5). `deny` daftar blok `sudo*`, jadi eskalasi hak istimewa langsung melalui `sudo` tidak tersedia."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Mitigasi:** `sandbox.enabled: true` dengan `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` menolak untuk memulai ketika backend tidak tersedia. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` Menolak `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` alat parameter, sehingga tidak ada per- panggilan escape."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let's Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Mode- sadar:** tidak ada sumber opsional yang dilewati, tidak gagal, sehingga peran yang sama bekerja dalam baik diri - ditandatangani dan Mari Encrypt setup."

