# libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**Kepercayaan OIDC JVM CA (self-signed TLS only):** ketika `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, perintah backend (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) mengimpor internal CA kedalam writeable `cacerts` salin dan arahkan JVM melalui `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. Berbagi `with-ca-trust.sh` titik masuk mencakup OS/NSS/env toko terpercaya tapi bukan toko trust JVM, jadi tanpa ini PenpotServer- sisi OIDC token / ureninfo panggilan ke Keycloak gagal dengan `PKIX path building failed`. override berada di belakang mode sendiri-signed (ini adalah sebuah no- op dalam produksi, dimana cert nyata CA-signed telah dipercaya) dan jalur CA dikodekan karena framework 's CA-override ulang-serialises perintah."

# libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**Kepercayaan OIDC JVM CA (self-signed TLS only):** ketika ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, perintah backend (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) mengimpor internal CA kedalam writeable ``cacerts`` salin dan arahkan JVM melalui ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. Berbagi ``with-ca-trust.sh`` titik masuk mencakup OS/NSS/env toko terpercaya tapi bukan toko trust JVM, jadi tanpa ini PenpotServer- sisi OIDC token / ureninfo panggilan ke Keycloak gagal dengan ``PKIX path building failed``. override berada di belakang mode sendiri-signed (ini adalah sebuah no- op dalam produksi, dimana cert nyata CA-signed telah dipercaya) dan jalur CA dikodekan karena framework 's CA-override ulang-serialises perintah."

