# libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` and writes the flag via ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
msgstr "**Pertama-per- bermain idempotensi:** Wraps the dispatch in ``when: run_once_update is not defined`` dan menulis bendera melalui ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``, jadi doa berulang dalam satu play adalah no- ops."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Once-per-play idempotency:** Wraps the dispatch in `when: run_once_update is not defined` and writes the flag via `tasks/utils/once/flag.yml`, so repeated invocations within one play are no-ops."
