# libretranslate
msgid "**Required addons are explicit, and install failure is gated by `required`.** Every addon carries a boolean `required` field (default `false`). Core components that are part of the deployed app contract, such as Odoo's core modules, use `required: true`: they are always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. The field also governs install-failure behaviour: when an addon's installation fails, a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play (the deploy stops), while a `required: false` addon MUST only emit a warning, skip that addon, and let the play continue."
msgstr "**Addon yang diperlukan eksplisit, dan kegagalan instalasi digated oleh `required`.** Setiap addon membawa boolean `required` field (baku `false`). Komponen inti yang merupakan bagian dari kontrak aplikasi yang dikerahkan, seperti modul inti Odoo, gunakan `required: true`: mereka selalu diinstal, omit MY `enabled`, dan HARUS TIDAK diset `enabled: false`. Bidang juga mengatur instalasi-perilaku kegagalan: ketika instalasi addon gagal, sebuah `required: true` addon HARUS keras-gagal bermain (the outrents stops), sementara `required: false` addon HARUS hanya memancarkan peringatan, melewati addon itu, dan membiarkan bermain terus."

