# libretranslate
msgid "**Sandbox** (precedence 3): everything else runs under `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Writes outside `allowWrite` fail with `EROFS`; reads from `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc. are denied; outbound connections to anything not in `allowedDomains` fail."
msgstr "**Sandbox** (mendahului 3): segala sesuatu yang lain berjalan di bawah `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Menulis di luar `allowWrite` gagal dengan `EROFS`; baca dari `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc ditolak; outbound koneksi untuk apa pun tidak dalam `allowedDomains` gagal."

