msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**"
msgstr "**Jembatan SSO Trusted- Header:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**   When the oauth2-proxy SSO flavor is active, Snipe-IT's native `loginViaRemoteUser()` is enabled via the `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). nginx gates `/login` through oauth2-proxy/Keycloak and injects the verified `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, which Snipe-IT matches against `users.username` (the user must pre-exist and be activated — sync them via LDAP) to mint a native `snipeit_session`. Visitors without a matching activated user silently fall through to the normal login form (no error). The password/LDAP login form stays available as a fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), and the in-app logout is redirected to the central OIDC end-session URL."
msgstr "**Jembatan SSO Trusted- Header:** Ketika oauth2-proxy Rasa SSO aktif, Snipe- IT 's asli `loginViaRemoteUser()` diaktifkan melalui `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). gerbang nginx `/login` melalui oauth2-proxy /Keycloak dan menyuntikkan diverifikasi `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, yang Snoope- IT cocok dengan `users.username` (pengguna harus pre-exist dan diaktifkan - sync mereka via LDAP) Untuk mint pribumi `snipeit_session`. Pengunjung tanpa pasangan pengguna yang diaktifkan diam-diam jatuh melalui ke bentuk log masuk normal (tidak ada error). Formulir log masuk sandi / LDAP tetap tersedia sebagai fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), dan logout in- app diarahkan ke pusat URL akhir sesi OIDC."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-header SSO bridge:** Establishes the owner session from the oauth2-proxy identity (see below)."
msgstr "**Jembatan SSO yang dipercaya:** Menetapkan sesi pemilik dari oauth2-proxy identitas (lihat dibawah)."

