# libretranslate
msgid "**Use Encrypted Systems** You SHOULD run Infinito.Nexus only on systems with full disk encryption. For example, Linux distributions such as [Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/) (based on ArchLinux) with desktop environments like [GNOME](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNOME) provide excellent security. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Gunakan Sistem Terenkripsi** Kau harus lari. Infinito.Nexus hanya pada sistem dengan enkripsi penuh disk. Misalnya, Linux distributions seperti [Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/) (berdasarkan ArchLinux) dengan lingkungan desktop seperti [GNOME](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNOME) memberikan keamanan yang sangat baik. (Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang [enkripsi disk](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) di Wikipedia.)"

# libretranslate
