msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Agen Hermes](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT)Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus kontainer mengeras. Kapal resmi dashboard web dengan **OIDC** auth (Cocok dengan platform SSO), delegasi bekerja melalui **subagen terisolasi**, memiliki memori persisten, penjadwalan, visi web browsing, dan dukungan MCP (**klien sejak v0.2.0, server sejak v0.6.0**)Dikerahkan sebagai `web-app-hermes`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm / pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (port baku `18789`) tambah CLI / TUI, kendali peramban, kotak pasir sistem berkas, memori persisten, keterampilan / plugin, dan asli MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, baik klien dan server)Dikerahkan sebagai `web-app-openclaw`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (Pass update async).** Bila ditata (atau `full_cycle=true` nyala `make compose-deploy`), pembungkus berjalan setiap putaran menyebarkan TWICE: pertama lulus sinkronisasi biasa, kemudian segera lulus kedua dengan `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding host_var, Terhadap folder varian SAME, sebelum pindah ke putaran berikutnya. Dua lewat oleh karena itu selalu berlokasi pada keadaan host yang sama; lulus async tidak pernah sengaja menargetkan host bahwa varian putaran sebelumnya tertinggal."

