msgid "A digital administration and documentation platform for structured organizations."
msgstr "Sebuah platform administrasi dan dokumentasi digital untuk organisasi terstruktur."

# libretranslate
msgid "A distro ships the interpreter and its extensions as separate packages, so a present ``php`` binary says nothing about them and ``ensure_command_present`` returns early on one. The extension is therefore probed against ``php -m``."
msgstr "Sebuah kapal distro penerjemah dan ekstensi sebagai paket terpisah, sehingga hadir ``php`` biner mengatakan apa-apa tentang mereka dan ``ensure_command_present`` kembali awal pada satu. Karena itu perpanjangan dicocokkan terhadap ``php -m``."

