# libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "Admission tinggal di `meta/services.yml`, tidak di sini. Sebuah set klien `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` dalam perannya sendiri; penyedia menolak satu dengan pengaturan `mcp_consumer: false` pada entri klien itu. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) membutuhkan setiap penyedia untuk membawa `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entri untuk setiap klien dideklarasikan, sehingga merencanakan bulat penyedia dan klien bersama-sama."

