# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same `(repository, ref)` shape as every other `meta/services.yml`, the existing `update-repository-refs` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via `git ls-remote --tags` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Karena pin menggunakan sama `(repository, ref)` bentuk sebagai setiap lainnya `meta/services.yml`, yang ada `update-repository-refs` Pekerjaan CI menemukan mereka sendiri: menyelesaikan tag semver terbaru dari setiap repositori melalui `git ls-remote --tags` dan membuka permintaan menarik dengan benjolan. Meningkatkan linter oleh karena itu komit ditinjau, bukan kejutan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same ``(repository, ref)`` shape as every other ``meta/services.yml``, the existing ``update-repository-refs`` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via ``git ls-remote --tags`` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
