# libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Usaha terbaik: peramban dalang tidak diunduh di sini (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) Jadi ``install-lint`` tetap pasir - aman. mmdc hanya perlu peramban ke RENDER, yang ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` ketentuan sesuai permintaan (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) tepat sebelum itu terjadi. Bahwa kapal peramban sebagai zip, jadi ``unzip`` Dijamin di sini (Extractor Dumpeteer membutuhkannya, selain itu meninggalkan versi dir kosong dan mmdc melaporkan peramban hilang). Sebuah instalasi gagal memperingatkan daripada membatalkan ``install-lint``, jadi sandboxes tanpa akses npm / browser masih mendapatkan sisa dari rantai alat lint."

