# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. The dashboard’s entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side ``oidc.js`` bundle, and ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Kedua karakter Playwright terotentikasi diblokir sementara ``services.sso.enabled`` adalah palsu. Seluruh dashboard Keycloak Integrasi adalah sisi browser- ``oidc.js`` bundel, dan ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` kapal yang hanya difungsikan ketika SSO diaktifkan, sehingga dengan SSO dari halaman tersebut tidak menghasilkan link Login maupun kontrol logout."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. Without SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` skips the ``auth_by_http_header`` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Kedua karakter Playwright terotentikasi diblokir sementara ``services.sso.enabled`` adalah palsu. Tanpa SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` melewati ``auth_by_http_header`` snippet, sehingga situs OMD kembali ke bentuk login sendiri."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. The dashboard's entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side `oidc.js` bundle, and `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` in `vars/main.yml` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Kedua karakter Playwright terotentikasi diblokir sementara `services.sso.enabled` adalah palsu. Seluruh dashboard Keycloak Integrasi adalah sisi browser- `oidc.js` bundel, dan `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` in `vars/main.yml` kapal yang hanya difungsikan ketika SSO diaktifkan, sehingga dengan SSO dari halaman tersebut tidak menghasilkan link Login maupun kontrol logout."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. Without SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` skips the `auth_by_http_header` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Kedua karakter Playwright terotentikasi diblokir sementara `services.sso.enabled` adalah palsu. Tanpa SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` melewati `auth_by_http_header` snippet, sehingga situs OMD kembali ke bentuk login sendiri."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked, and both are covered by bespoke tests in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` instead."
msgstr "Kedua orang yang terotentikasi Playwright diblokir, dan keduanya ditutupi oleh tes kata-kata dalam ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`` sebagai gantinya."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked, and both are covered by bespoke tests in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` instead."
