msgid "Both fields live on the role's **primary entity** in `meta/services.yml`, where `<primary_entity> = get_entity_name(role_name)`:"
msgstr "Kedua bidang hidup pada peran **entitas primer** in `meta/services.yml`, dimana `<primary_entity> = get_entity_name(role_name)`:"

