# libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that must name a model (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) read `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, which picks the first non-embedding preload model of `svc-ai-ollama` and mirrors the branch order of the gateway's own `config.yaml.j2`. The consumer resolves that branch from `lookup('deployment').inventory`, every group the round's inventory populates, read from the play-wide `groups` magic var. `.running` is wrong here: a targeted `apps=` round sets it to the whitelist, and `svc-ai-ollama` is pulled in as a dependency rather than named on the command line, so both backend branches fall through to the `openrouter/auto` vendor default. The gateway then answers `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` with HTTP 400 and no consumer can complete a prompt. `.groups` is wrong for the mirror-image reason: it carries `group_names`, which is host-scoped, so on a multi-host round a worker that hosts neither the gateway nor a backend resolves an empty model while the manager resolves the right one."
msgstr "Konsumen yang harus nama model (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) baca `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, yang memilih pertama bukan-embedding model preload dari `svc-ai-ollama` dan cermin urutan cabang dari gateway sendiri `config.yaml.j2`. Para konsumen menyelesaikan cabang dari `lookup('deployment').inventory`, setiap kelompok persediaan round 's populasi, dibaca dari bermain-lebar `groups` sihir var. `.running` salah di sini: target `apps=` bulat set ke whitelist, dan `svc-ai-ollama` Ditarik sebagai ketergantungan daripada dinamai pada baris perintah, sehingga kedua cabang backend jatuh ke `openrouter/auto` vendor default. Gateway kemudian menjawab `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` dengan HTTP 400 dan tidak ada konsumen dapat menyelesaikan prompt. `.groups` salah untuk mirror-image alasan: itu membawa `group_names`, yang host- scoped, sehingga pada putaran multi- host pekerja yang host tidak gateway atau backend menyelesaikan model kosong sementara manajer menyelesaikan yang benar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that take an explicit domain or read one from the environment fall back here rather than repeating the literal, so changing the CI/dev default is a one-line edit in ``default.env`` instead of a hunt through the tree."
msgstr "Konsumen yang mengambil domain eksplisit atau membacanya dari lingkungan kembali ke sini daripada mengulang literal, sehingga mengubah default CI / dev adalah edit satu baris di ``default.env`` bukan berburu melalui pohon."

