# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Probe layanan silang (biber ditolak di Prometheus, biber ditolak di matoo, dashboard ubin reachability) bukan bagian dari persona biber. Mereka hidup dalam spesifikasi penyedia sendiri (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameteried sekali selama penyedia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. Untuk dashboard, yang parameterised skenario delegasi ke `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, yang memiliki visibilitas ubin / iframe- embed / \"Tab\" pop- out pernyataan dalam satu SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Operasi Cross- service bukan bagian dari persona perole administrator. Rapabilitas ubin Dashboard dimiliki oleh `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, yang mendelegasikan per- target tubuh ke `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (lule terlihat memungkinkan klik loads dalam `#main iframe` Tajuk: \"Tab\" tombol membuka embed ke tab peramban segar). Bantuan itu adalah SPOT untuk mekanika dashboard-tile; spesifikasi konsumen HARUS TIDAK mengimplementasikan kembali salah satu pernyataan tersebut. Prometheus mengakui dan mengikis parity dimiliki oleh `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Keberadaan Macomo admin- dan pelacak dimiliki oleh `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Setiap penyedia paremeterises pernyataan atas nya `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Pengaturan permukaan layanan silang (dashboard tile reachability, progrenadmin- reach dan coretan parity, matoo admine- reach dan tracker appetment, biber- at-prognant, biber- denied-at-at-matomo) dimiliki oleh spesifikasi penyedia sendiri. Setiap penyedia paremeterises pernyataan atas nya `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, diberikan melalui `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Orang yang berperan sebagai konsumen tidak boleh menduplikasi probe ini."

