msgid "Easily customize your YOURLS instance through environment variables: set your site URL, admin credentials, and more."
msgstr "Mudah menyesuaikan Anda YOURLS instance melalui variabel lingkungan: atur URL situs Anda, kredensial admin, dan lebih."

