msgstr "Sunting `roles/<application_id>/meta/variants.yml` (buat berkas jika tidak ada)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Edit `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. You MUST NOT hand-edit the staged copy under `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; the rerunner overwrites it from the repo on each run."
msgstr "Sunting `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Anda HARUS TIDAK TANGAN-Edit dipentaskan salinan di bawah `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; tayangan ulang overwrite itu dari repo pada setiap run."

