# libretranslate
msgid "Element and Mattermost both support threaded replies. You MUST use threads to keep discussions focused and avoid cluttering the main timeline of a room or channel."
msgstr "Elemen dan Mattermost kedua dukungan threaded menjawab. Anda HARUS menggunakan benang untuk menjaga diskusi fokus dan menghindari cluttering timeline utama dari sebuah ruangan atau saluran."

# libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your LDAP directory management with LAM (LDAP Account Manager), a powerful solution for administering LDAP directories. LAM offers an intuitive web interface for managing users, groups, and other LDAP objects, making directory operations both efficient and secure."
