msgstr "SMTP tetap dalam CI dan DinD oleh pilihan dinamis port dan menonaktifkan otentikasi ketika TLS mati"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed WordPress multisite wp-config quoting, hardcoded plugin-enable lookups, discourse-integration ordering, and per-variant Discourse toggle gating"
msgstr "Tetap WordPress multisite wp-config mengutip, hardcode plugin- memungkinkan pencarian, menyatakan-integrasi pemesanan, dan per- varian Discourse ubah gating"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed deploy resolution, AUR installs (use ***aur_builder***), Debian/Ubuntu images (openssh-client), CI rate limits (***NIX_CONFIG***), plus general test and security fixes."
msgstr "Resolusi pengiriman tetap, UR installs (gunakan ***aur_builder***), gambar Debian / Ubuntu (buka-klien), batas tingkat CI (***NIX_CONFIG***), ditambah tes umum dan perbaikan keamanan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed env-test suites: dynamic Fedora release resolution in the cache probe, compose-network discovery for the DiD probe, and oauth2-proxy allowed_groups slash normalization"
msgstr "Hasil tes tetap: dynamic Fedora rilis resolusi dalam probe cache, compose- penemuan jaringan untuk DiD probe, dan oauth2-proxy allowed_groups slash normalisasi"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed flaky Nix-related network failures and added explicit failure-path coverage for retry handling"
msgstr "Kegagalan jaringan yang berhubungan dengan Nix-tetap dan menambahkan cakupan jalan eksplisit untuk penanganan ulang"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed integration tests **CI Enhancements**"
msgstr "Tes integrasi tetap **Perbaikan CI**"

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Fixed meta drift: req-008 sweep gaps (lost suppressions, silent test breakage, one prod bug), host-bound port collisions on 8071/8072, subnet collisions on 192.168.105.{48,64}/28, and Moodle resource limits"
msgstr "Drift meta tetap: req-008 menyapu kesenjangan (hilang tekanan, tes diam breage, satu prod bug), Host-bound port collisions on 8071/8072, subnet tabrakan pada 192.168.105.{48,64}/28, dan Moodle batas sumber daya"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed multiple domain, CSP, email, lookup, and proxy wiring issues uncovered during the applications / users migration"
msgstr "Fixing domain, CSP, email, pencarian, dan masalah kabel proksi ditemukan selama migrasi aplikasi / pengguna"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed reusable workflow wait parameter wiring and test-dns CI image selection"
msgstr "Berjalan ulang yang dapat digunakan menunggu parameter kabel dan test- dns pilihan gambar CI"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed systemd-in-container boot hangs by disabling systemd-firstboot and initializing machine-id"
msgstr "Sistem tetap-in-container boot digantung dengan menonaktifkan system-first boot dan menginisialisasi machine-id"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed the Joomla install / re-deploy flow across the open regression classes: raw-git-tree refusal handling, re-deploy idempotency, dash pipefail incompatibility, cleanup-phase crashes, and fresh-install password-reset races"
msgstr "Tetap Joomla pasang / pasang aliran di kelas regresi terbuka: raw-git-tree menolak penanganan, re-menyebarkan idempotency, garis pipefail tidak kompatibel, crash fase bersih, dan baru-memasang passwords -reset ras"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed the sys-svc-container package selection on Ubuntu; the Makefile clean target is resilient to container-owned **pycache** files"
msgstr "Tetap sys-svc-container pilihan paket di Ubuntu; target membersihkan Makefile adalah suffeent ke insurer- dimiliki **pycache** berkas"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed undefined *run_once* lookup in backend service loader"
msgstr "Tetap tak terdefinisi *run_once* pencarian dalam pemuat layanan backend"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fixed utils.cache Ansible coupling: data is importable without ansible, the GID resolver works without ansible, and the YAML cache invalidates per-path entries when mtime/size changes"
msgstr "Tetap utils.cache Kopling ansible: data tidak penting tanpa masuk akal, resolver GID bekerja tanpa masuk akal, dan cache YAML menginvalidasi entri perpath ketika perubahan mtime / size"

# libretranslate
