# libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Garpu [rpardini / docker-registry- proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) dan mengajar bundled nginx untuk menangani GCP Artifact Registry redirect URL (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)Saat ini `gcr.io` blob menarik bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), yang merupakan solusi yang menonaktifkan caching bagi mereka registry. Jangka panjang: rebase upstream `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` aturan untuk mengenali bentuk redirect baru, kapal perbaikan di garpu kami, titik `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (atau tag gambarnya) di garpu, dan drop `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Garpu `pull_request` jalankan selalu menerima tanda baca-saja (GitHub- dipaksa); label tidak pernah memberikan tanda-tanda tulis atau rahasia untuk kejadian yang tidak terpercaya."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Fork main- branch sync: push entry workflow sekarang sinkronisasi repositori sekarang *utama* dari suatu repositori sumber yang dikonfigurasi (baku *tidak terhingga-nexus / core*) sebelum scope CI dan menyebarkan penemuan berjalan, sehingga mendorong cabang fork hanya melihat perubahan sendiri terhadap basis up- to-date. Sumber ini overriable atau dapat dilepas melalui *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* variabel repositori, dan gaya sinkronisasi -overwriting *utama*, sehingga sebuah repositori synced tidak boleh digunakan sebagai sebuah branch kerja. Lihat [Referensi konfigurasi Aksi](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

