msgstr "Fork, PR, rilis, atau jalur yang dijadwalkan terkena:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Fork- PR CI hardening (Mengikuti-sampai ke 11.1.0 aliran trusted- fork): yang istimewa *pull_request_target* produser gambar dan cermin sekarang diset *allow--unsafe- pr- checkout* Jadi *aksi / keluar* berhenti menolak menggabungkan fork ref itu mulai menolak. Fork tak dipercaya dibangun tanpa rahasia organisasi - mereka otentikasi ke GHCR dengan per- pekerjaan *GITHUB_TOKEN* Hanya dan cermin Docker Hub anonim - sementara jalan utama-terpercaya terus kredensial penuh dan membangun kepala PR mentah. Switch kepercayaan dipindahkan ke *🛡️ Dipercaya* label. Lihat [baris pipa fork-PR](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) dan [referensi otentikasi GHCR](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

