msgstr "Masukan (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (baku ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``)Opsional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (dikonsumsi oleh ``derive_includes``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``INV_DIR`` — inventory dir holding ``host_vars/*.yml`` (default ``/tmp/inv``)."
msgstr "Masukan (env): ``INV_DIR`` - dir inventaris dipegang ``host_vars/*.yml`` (baku ``/tmp/inv``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). A second ed25519 keypair is generated at ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) and its public half lands in ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` so the DR drill's backup host can pull over the ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. The ``applications`` block written into the extras file carries the ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source device paths, which is all the DR drill reads back from it. The deploy-facing overrides, including ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (derived per round from ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), are baked by the matrix orchestrator into the provisioner's host_vars merge (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NOT into the extras file: extra-vars replace the whole inventory ``applications`` dict and would strip every generated credential. ``users`` carries the same hazard for the same reason, and its authorized_keys travel the same merge channel. The deploy-facing twin ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` therefore carries everything except ``applications`` and ``users``."
msgstr "Masukan (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (baku ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (baku ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``)Sebuah ed kedua25519 keypair dihasilkan di ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) dan setengah tanah publik di ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` Sehingga DR bor apos; s host cadangan dapat menepi ``user-backup`` ssh- pembungkus. The ``applications`` blok yang ditulis ke dalam berkas tambahan membawa ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source jalur perangkat, yang semua DR bor baca kembali dari itu. Penyebaran menghadap menimpa, termasuk ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (turunan per putaran dari ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), dipanggang oleh matriks antristrator ke provisioner 's host_vars merge (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), TIDAK ke dalam berkas ekstra: extra-vars mengganti seluruh persediaan ``applications`` dekrit dan akan strip setiap kredensial dihasilkan. ``users`` membawa bahaya yang sama untuk alasan yang sama, dan authorized_keys melakukan penggabungan saluran yang sama. The Penyebaran menghadap kembar ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` maka membawa semuanya kecuali ``applications`` dan ``users``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs come from the merged application config (``services.<key>.image`` and ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` and ``version=`` keyword overrides bypass those values for ad-hoc references (e.g. side-car init containers that do not appear in the services map)."
msgstr "Masukan berasal dari konfigurasi aplikasi tergabung (``services.<key>.image`` dan ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` dan ``version=`` kata kunci overrides bypass nilai-nilai untuk referensi ad-hoc (Misalnya samping-car init kontainer yang tidak muncul dalam peta layanan)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs the retrigger reads from the job log rather than the run title."
msgstr "Masukan retrigger dibaca dari log pekerjaan daripada judul berjalan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs 🔧"
msgstr "Masukan 🔧"

# libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Di dalam sebuah drama batas proses adalah tugas: garansi ansible untuk pekerja per tugas, jadi `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` Mulai kosong di setiap pekerja. `get_merged_applications` Oleh karena itu juga menerima play- scoped pembawa fakta `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parted once by the constructor stage) dan melayani ketika kunci cocok. Lihat [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) untuk kontrak."

