# libretranslate
msgid "New *web-app-n8n* role: n8n workflow automation (Community Edition). SSO is wired through a trusted-header edge hook that is copied and mounted only when SSO is enabled (native SSO is enterprise-only in CE), LDAP sign-in is supported, and per-scenario Playwright coverage exercises the CE edge-SSO model. Ships at lifecycle *alpha*; subnet and port collisions with the new *web-app-semaphore* role were resolved on the way in. See the [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."
msgstr "Baru *web-app-n8n* peran: n8otomatisasi arus kerja n (Edisi Komunitas). SSO tersambung melalui kait pinggir header yang disalin dan dikait hanya ketika SSO diaktifkan (SSO asli hanya digunakan di CE), LDAP sign-in didukung, dan per- skenario cakupan naskah latihan CE edge- SSO model. Kapal di lifecycle *alfa*; subnet dan port tabrakan dengan baru *web-app-semaphore* Peran diselesaikan dalam perjalanan masuk Lihat [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Apps"
msgstr "App Baru"

# libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Baru ERPNext peran yang kapal upstream Frappe Framework15 stack sebagai web-app-erpnext peran - backend, frontend, websocket, penjadwalan dan dua pekerja antrian - kabel ke pusat Keycloak via a built- in Keycloak Kunci Login Sosial dan ke pusat OpenLDAP melalui LDAP Pengaturan doctype. Matriks tiga varian (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) adalah diolah akhir-to-end dan sebuah tutup litt seluruh ansible nama tugas di 120 karakter."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Baru Jitsi Meet peran yang menambahkan sebuah oauth2-proksi pertemuan permukaan plus pencocokan LDAP- varian Playwright cakupan. Tata letak spesifikasi diatur ulang menjadi modul bersama dan berkas tes per- skenario sehingga skenario masa depan dapat ditambahkan tanpa menyentuh monolith tersebut."

# libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "Kami seharusnya tidak diciptakan. Tempatkan pengguna di bawah `OU.USERS`, RBAC peran di bawah `OU.ROLES`, dan organisasi kelompok di bawah `OU.GROUPS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Baru Penpot peran (web-app-penpot, persyaratan 235) yang kapal hulu Penpot platform desain yang terdiri frontend, backend, exportir dan Redis di versi gambar 2.5.4, kabel ke pusat Keycloak via OIDC dan menuju pusat OpenLDAP. Local- login sandi asli tersedia sebagai sebuah toggle yang dinonaktifkan secara otomatis di bawah OIDC, dengan tanda login dan pendaftaran berasal dari flag SSO. Toko trust JVM kustom impor Infinito sendiri-ditanda-tangani CA sehingga OIDC atas TLS sukses, dan perannya dilaksanakan akhir-ke-akhir dengan Dramawan meliputi log masuk OIDC, log keluar dan pembuatan proyek. Jaringan internet lokal dipindah ke 192.168.105.192/28 untuk menghindari tabrakan dengan ERPNext Jangkauan."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Peran lubang pipa baru (*web-app-pihole*) bahwa kapal hulu Pi-hole DNS sinkhole dan jaringan-lebar ad blocker, dengan admin antarmuka web gated di belakang *oauth2-proxy* dan Keycloak RBAC dan sebuah login admin- password (yang *FTLCONF* web API sandi) tersedia sebagai varian fallback. Resolver upstream dan zona waktu dapat diatur, peran menunggu pada ujung Pi-hole HTTP selama menyebarkan, dan itu dilaksanakan akhir-ke-akhir dengan Playwright meliputi OAuth2, native- login dan guest- skenario akses. Peran kapal di lifecycle beta."

# libretranslate
msgid "New `--mirror` support for inventory generation"
msgstr "Baru `--mirror` dukungan untuk pembuatan inventaris"

# libretranslate
msgid "New addon suggestions MUST include enough data for review: role id, addon id, upstream id, mechanism, source, catalog URL, and why the addon is considered relevant."
