msgid "New packaging lint: a *lint-packages* check, wired into *make lint* and its own CI workflow, validates the generated *debian/changelog* with *dpkg-parsechangelog*, the Fedora spec with *rpmspec* and the Arch *PKGBUILD* with a *bash -n* syntax pass, failing on any parser warning rather than only on a non-zero exit. A complementary *test-lint* check asserts that both package changelogs list every released version and that their inline window matches CHANGELOG.md. See [the workflow catalog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Lembar kemasan baru: a *Lint- paket* check, wired into *buat lint* dan sendiri arus kerja CI, memvalidasi yang dihasilkan *debian / changelog* dengan *dpkg-parsechangelog*, Spec Fedora dengan *rpmspec* dan Arch *PKGBUILD* dengan *Bash -n* syntax pass, failed on any parser warning than only on a non-zero exit. Sebuah komplementer *test-lint* cek menegaskan bahwa baik paket changelogs senarai setiap versi yang dirilis dan bahwa jendela inline mereka cocok CHANGELOG.md. Lihat [katalog arus kerja](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

