# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Manajer paket sistem operasi seperti [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) dan [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep install software in sync with their upstream distribution repositori. Masing-masing kapal dengan berbeda perintah permukaan tetapi mereka semua melayani tujuan yang sama: menyegarkan indeks dan upgrade setiap paket terpasang pada host."

