msgid "Per-role update PRs: the Docker-image-version and repository-ref updaters now open one pull request per affected role instead of a single combined PR, and they recompute the diff against the latest *main* at run time — the update jobs check out *main* rather than the triggering commit, so a queued or stale run no longer proposes already-merged changes or bundles unrelated roles. Each role gets its own branch (*update/<type>-<role>-<date>-<fingerprint>*) and a role-scoped duplicate check, while the *skills-lock.json* updater deliberately stays a single PR. See [the update workflow catalog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Perrole update PRs: Docker-image- versi dan repository- ref updater sekarang membuka satu permintaan tarik per peran terpengaruh daripada sebuah PR gabungan tunggal, dan mereka menghitung ulang diff terhadap yang terbaru *utama* pada waktu berjalan - pekerjaan update check out *utama* daripada melakukan pemicu, sehingga antrian atau jalankan basi tidak lagi mengusulkan already-merged perubahan atau bundel peran yang tidak berhubungan. Setiap peran mendapat cabangnya sendiri (*perbarui /<type>-<role>-<date>-<fingerprint>*) dan role- scoped duplikat cek, sementara *Keahlian-lock.json* updater sengaja tetap PR tunggal. Lihat [katalog update alur kerja](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

