# libretranslate
msgid "Real Nextcloud integration coupling: end-to-end tests now assert genuine two-way OAuth/API coupling for *gitlab*, *mattermost*, *openproject*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *discourse*, *github*, *google*, *jira*, *mastodon*, *matrix*, *moodle* and *suitecrm*, rather than the mere presence of a connect button. All integration OAuth credentials are stored Nextcloud-encrypted via ICrypto (sensitive app values), OpenProject and Zammad secrets survive a re-deploy, and OpenWebUI/Ollama is wired in as a real *integration_openai* chat backend. Bridges with no Nextcloud-33 plugin (Moodle, SuiteCRM) are disabled."
msgstr "Nyata Nextcloud integrasi kopling: end-to-end test sekarang menegaskan asli dua arah OAuth /API kopling untuk *Gitlab*, *mattermost*, *membuka projek*, *Zammad*, *peertube*, *watter*, *ithub*, *Google*, *Jira*, *mastodon*, *matriks*, *moodle* dan *codecrm*, daripada hanya kehadiran tombol koneksi. Semua kredensial OAuth integrasi disimpan Nextcloud-encrypted via ICrypto (nilai aplikasi sensitif), OpenProject dan Zammad rahasia bertahan hidup kembali menyebarkan, dan OpenWebUI /Ollama adalah kabel sebagai nyata *integration_openai* Backend obrolan. Jembatan dengan tidak Nextcloud-33 plugin (Moodle, SuiteCRM) dinonaktifkan."

