# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip. Pertama dimulai dengan unit cadangan yang telah dikerahkan (diferensial segar `backup-nfs-to-local` generasi dari ekspor langsung), kemudian cermin snapshot ke target (`rsync -a --delete`, dengan berbagi `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copy in). `--no-safety-backup` melewati unit berjalan ketika target memegang tidak layak disimpan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip. Pertama dimulai dengan unit cadangan yang telah dikerahkan (generasi baurdolo segar dari setiap volume dan basis data), menyelesaikan titik gunung volume dan cermin snapshot ke dalamnya (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` melewati unit berjalan ketika target memegang tidak layak disimpan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip. Pertama dimulai dengan unit cadangan yang telah dikerahkan (diferensial segar ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generasi dari ekspor langsung), kemudian cermin snapshot ke target (``rsync -a --delete``, dengan berbagi ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copy in). ``--no-safety-backup`` melewati unit berjalan ketika target memegang tidak layak disimpan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip. Pertama dimulai dengan unit cadangan yang telah dikerahkan (generasi baurdolo segar dari setiap volume dan basis data), menyelesaikan titik gunung volume dan cermin snapshot ke dalamnya (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` melewati unit berjalan ketika target memegang tidak layak disimpan."

