# libretranslate
msgid "Single point of truth for proprietary / external API credentials. Resolves a dotted path against the effective ``API`` mapping: the declaration in group_vars/all/18_api.yml with the calling scope's override merged over it. Routing every access through this plugin keeps one place to change how proprietary API credentials are sourced (vault, env, secret manager, a different provider abstraction) without touching the call sites."
msgstr "Satu titik kebenaran bagi kepemilikan / eksternal API Kredensial. Resolves a dotted path against the efektif ``API`` pemetaan: deklarasi dalam group_vars/all/18_api.yml dengan panggilan override 's override di atasnya. Routing setiap akses melalui plugin ini menyimpan satu tempat untuk mengubah bagaimana proprietary API kredensial adalah sumber (lemari besi, env, manajer rahasia, sebuah operator abstraksi berbeda) tanpa menyentuh situs panggilan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Single point of truth for the repo-root anchor, replacing the repeated ``[playbook_dir, '<rel>'] | path_join`` boilerplate at cross-role include/template/script/src call sites. Joins every term, so a path may be passed whole ('roles/x/y.yml') or split across terms when a segment is a variable (``lookup('path_absolute', 'roles', system_service_role_name)``)."
msgstr "Satu titik kebenaran untuk repo- akar jangkar, menggantikan pengulangan ``[playbook_dir, '<rel>'] | path_join`` boilerplate di cross- role include/template/script/src situs panggilan. Gabungan setiap istilah, sehingga jalan dapat dilewatkan secara keseluruhan ('roles/x/y.yml') atau split seluruh istilah ketika sebuah segmen adalah sebuah variabel (``lookup('path_absolute', 'roles', system_service_role_name)``)."

