msgid "Single source of truth for the node's onion identity: ``ensure_node_onion`` mints/reuses the key files here and the ``svc-net-tor`` role copies them into the running daemon. Lives outside anything the deploy regenerates and is mounted into the DiD at ``{playbook_dir}/.onion-identity/hs``."
msgstr "Sumber kebenaran tunggal untuk identitas bawang node: ``ensure_node_onion`` mint / reuses berkas kunci di sini dan ``svc-net-tor`` role menyalin mereka ke daemon berjalan. Tinggal di luar apa pun menyebarkan regenerasi dan dipasang ke DID di ``{playbook_dir}/.onion-identity/hs``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for the per-addon enable flags consumed by the Playwright addon-gating helper (``tests/addon-gating.js`` -> ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Replaces the error-prone per-template Jinja loop: it resolves the materialised ``addons`` mapping for ``application_id`` and returns one ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` line per declared addon (sorted by env key, newline-joined), where the env-key derivation matches addon-gating.js exactly."
msgstr "Sumber kebenaran tunggal untuk per-addon mengaktifkan bendera dikonsumsi oleh Playwright addon- gating helper (``tests/addon-gating.js`` - > ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Menggantikan kesalahan-rentan dalam template Jache loop: menyelesaikan materialised ``addons`` pemetaan untuk ``application_id`` dan kembali satu ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` baris per deklarasi addon (diurutkan dengan kunci env, baris-baru tergabung), dimana env-key derivation cocok dengan-gating.js Tepat."

# libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for: parsing raw service-config resource scalars, evaluating the enabled/shared/container predicates, walking a role's services (resolving template-gated shared services to the provider role's entity via the service registry, loading each service once unless ``dedup=False``), and aggregating the collected rows into a budget."
msgstr "Sumber kebenaran tunggal untuk: parsing raw service- config skalar sumber daya, mengevaluasi enabled/shared/container memprediksi, berjalan layanan peran (memilah-milah layanan bersama ke entitas peran penyedia melalui daftar layanan, memuat setiap layanan sekali kecuali jika ``dedup=False``), dan mengumpulkan baris dikumpulkan ke dalam anggaran."

