# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe- IT dimasukkan melalui jembatan header trust: oauth2-proxy otentikasi terhadap Keycloak dan Snipe- IT 's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mint sebuah sesi asli untuk pencocokan `users.username` baris (lihat [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php))Gerbang menyatakan tidak `allowed_groups`, jadi `biber` melewati proksi - tetapi ketentuan peran hanya akun administrator ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), sehingga header membawa sebuah nama pengguna Snipe- IT tidak tahu dan pengunjung jatuh kembali ke bentuk login asli. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Oleh karena itu menyatakan `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, sementara `administrator` persona tetap hidup (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) dan latihan jembatan penuh berakhir."

# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe- IT dimasukkan melalui jembatan header trust: oauth2-proxy otentikasi terhadap Keycloak dan Snipe- IT 's ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mint sebuah sesi asli untuk pencocokan ``users.username`` baris (lihat ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) dan latihan jembatan penuh berakhir."

# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "Snipe AffIT adalah sistem manajemen aset sumber terbuka yang dirancang untuk memperkecil perangkat keras dan pelacakan perangkat lunak. Penempatan ini menyediakan otomatis, solusi inkuterisasi menggunakan Docker Compose, terpusat MariaDB integrasi basis data, dan aman, pengaturan lingkungan yang dapat diatur, termasuk dukungan email SMTP yang kuat dan tertunda peningkatan otentikasi SAML."

# libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Jadi `meta/services.yml` HARUS TIDAK memiliki tingkat atas `services:` kunci melipat isinya. `meta/volumes.yml` HARUS TIDAK memiliki tingkat atas `volumes:` kunci, dan aturan yang sama berlaku untuk `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, dan `meta/info.yml`. Nama berkas saja yang memperbaiki awalan path dalam pohon aplikasi yang terwujud, yang membuat jalur konsumen pendek dan dapat diprediksi (tidak berlebihan `compose.…` prefix)."

# libretranslate
msgid "So a conditional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` edge pulls its provider into the static closure regardless of whether `web-app-matomo` is actually selected. The closure is the co-deploy superset."
msgstr "Jadi kondisional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` ujung menarik penyedia ke penutupan statis terlepas dari apakah `web-app-matomo` sebenarnya dipilih. Penutupan adalah co-menyebarkan superset."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "So the format is read from the workflow itself. Every input renders as one segment, ``<head><value> ``, where the head is the emoji the workflow's own ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` prefixes the value with. An input holding its default renders no segment at all, so a title carries only what deviates — and an absent input means \"the workflow's default\", which is exactly what a retrigger should leave alone."
msgstr "Jadi format dibaca dari alur kerja itu sendiri. Setiap masukan dibuat sebagai satu segmen, ``<head><value> ``, dimana kepala adalah emoji yang mengalir sendiri ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` prefix nilai dengan. Sebuah masukan memegang default render tidak ada segmen sama sekali, sehingga judul hanya membawa apa yang menyimpang - dan masukan absen berarti \"arus kerja baku\", yang persis apa yang memicu harus meninggalkan sendirian."

