msgid "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : The app authenticates against its own `platform_users` table. There is no OIDC client and no   auto-provisioning, so the biber account never exists inside Social Home. Path back: upstream   grows an OIDC/trusted-header auth path."
